
<svelte:head><title>Social Impact — Grid Ubuntu</title><meta name="description" content="Grid Ubuntu: shared solar energy and intelligent community energy management, built in Zimbabwe for African communities."/></svelte:head>
<section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F4F7F4] to-white px-6 py-20"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center"><p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Social Impact</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Energy access is a human right,<br/>not a market privilege.</h1><p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">In rural Zimbabwe, 60% of the population lives without reliable grid electricity. Grid Ubuntu is changing that — one community at a time.</p></div></section><section class="px-6 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2"><div><div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">For Local Households</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">A reliable power connection transforms daily life. Children study beyond sunset. Families cook safely without kerosene fumes. Medical devices stay charged. Mobile phones — the lifeline to employment and family — remain online.</p><ul class="mt-6 space-y-3"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A] text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>Clean lighting for evening study — no more smoky lanterns</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A] text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>Phone charging available throughout the day</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A] text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>Small fan or radio during hot season</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A] text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>Elimination of kerosene-related household fires</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C]"><span class="mt-1 flex h-4 w-4 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3BAF4A]/15 text-[#3BAF4A] text-[10px] font-bold">✓</span>Predictable, affordable monthly energy cost</li></ul></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#1A2B1C] to-[#2D4A2F] p-8 text-white"><p class="text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#9EB09F]">Household Snapshot</p><div class="mt-6 space-y-5"><div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-5"><p class="text-xs text-[#9EB09F]">Average monthly cost</p><p class="mt-1 text-xl font-extrabold text-[#8DC63F]">$1.25 USD</p><p class="text-xs text-[#5A6E5C]">vs $4–8 for kerosene</p></div><div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-5"><p class="text-xs text-[#9EB09F]">Daily kWh allocation</p><p class="mt-1 text-xl font-extrabold text-[#8DC63F]">0.5 – 2 kWh</p><p class="text-xs text-[#5A6E5C]">Based on household tier</p></div><div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-5"><p class="text-xs text-[#9EB09F]">Setup cost for household</p><p class="mt-1 text-xl font-extrabold text-[#8DC63F]">$0</p><p class="text-xs text-[#5A6E5C]">Community-funded infrastructure</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F4F7F4] px-6 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2"><div class="order-2 lg:order-1"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><span class="text-2xl">🏪</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">General stores</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#9EB09F] leading-relaxed">Refrigeration for perishables and extended trading hours</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><span class="text-2xl">✂️</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Tailoring shops</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#9EB09F] leading-relaxed">Sewing machines and irons running reliably through business hours</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><span class="text-2xl">📡</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Phone charging</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#9EB09F] leading-relaxed">Community charging hubs generating additional household income</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><span class="text-2xl">🌾</span><p class="mt-3 text-sm font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Agriculture</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#9EB09F] leading-relaxed">Cold storage for produce, reducing post-harvest loss by up to 40%</p></div></div></div><div class="order-1 lg:order-2"><div class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#F5A623]/15 text-[#D97706]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">For Small Businesses</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Unreliable power is the single biggest constraint on rural economic activity. A stable micro-grid turns a 6-hour shop into a 12-hour shop. It means produce doesn&#x27;t spoil. It means a tailoring business can take on more orders. It means the local economy grows.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="px-6 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="text-center mb-12"><div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-[#8DC63F]/15 text-[#71A030]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-leaf" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"></path><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"></path></svg></div><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Environmental Accountability</h2><p class="mt-4 max-w-xl mx-auto text-[#5A6E5C]">Every kWh distributed through Grid Ubuntu displaces fossil fuel energy. We track this impact in real time.</p></div><div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3"><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-[#D97706] bg-[#F5A623]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sun" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"></circle><path d="M12 2v2"></path><path d="M12 20v2"></path><path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"></path><path d="M2 12h2"></path><path d="M20 12h2"></path><path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"></path><path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Solar only</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">100% of energy distributed comes from photovoltaic solar panels — zero combustion, zero emissions at point of use.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-[#71A030] bg-[#8DC63F]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-leaf" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"></path><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">CO₂ displacement</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Each kWh of solar energy displaces approximately 0.5kg of CO₂ equivalent compared to diesel generators.</p></div><div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-7 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-[#E3EDE3]"><div class="mb-4 flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl text-[#3BAF4A] bg-[#3BAF4A]/10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 7h6v6"></path><path d="m22 7-8.5 8.5-5-5L2 17"></path></svg></div><h3 class="font-bold text-[#1A2B1C]">Measured impact</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#5A6E5C] leading-relaxed">Our EMS records every kWh distributed. Impact metrics update live from actual usage data — no estimates.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-[#F4F7F4] px-6 py-16"><div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center"><h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[#1A2B1C]">Want to support this work?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[#5A6E5C]">Grid Ubuntu is actively expanding. If you represent an NGO, impact fund, or development organisation, we&#x27;d love to share our full impact data and expansion roadmap with you.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-[#3BAF4A] px-7 py-3.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md hover:bg-[#2D9039]" href="/contact">Get in Touch <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></section>